  triage:closureNote "(a) test_migrate_benchmark_history.py now exercises updated_baselines() against a windows-x64-02/tcp source and asserts the generated Windows seed's p50_floor/effective_from/approved_by, closing the untested-generator gap (commit ea5a3b016). (b) artifacts/benchmark/migration-audit.json and migration-audit.html now exist as the sign-off artifact." ;
